\ The raise from tests/integration/tail_boundary_compiled_caller.1z, built interpreter-free. The
\ locked class refuses the build: the quotation `go` hands to `when` falls back to the
\ interpreter, so no chain renders in this class at all. The raise is left uncaught so the
\ refusal names that one site rather than the `inspect` a `recover` handler would add.

boom: ( -- ) [ f "kaboom" EUserThrown make-error throw ] ;
go: ( ? -- ) [ [ boom ] when ] ;

t go
